"Dragon Veins are underground Qi channels that cultivators can draw on or feed."
"Earth Spirits exist as Shennong's dying safeguard against beasts that devour whole worlds."
"Land spirits reflect both a place's physical reality and what people believe of it."
"A land spirit's form and personality shift as belief in it changes."
"Spirits can act against common belief and reshape their own nature over time."
"A Provincial Spirit governs a web of minor land spirits who swear it fealty."
"Lesser garden and mountain spirits regulate a region's Dragon Veins under Natural Law."
"Many minor land spirits shattered millennia ago, leaving gaps in the spirit web."
"Minor land spirits can form from belief and Qi, such as a snowman built with devotion."
"The Warden is a minor spirit who fell in battle, reborn through belief in his retrieved hat."
"The Captain who Braves the Devil Storms is a minor spirit made and empowered by guards."
"Earth Spirits keep real independence from their rules, not forced obedience."
"An Earth Spirit's contract with its Connected One binds far harder than its other rules."
"An Earth Spirit can form a private mental bond with a landowner who tends its land well."
"An Earth Spirit bond can grant Qi-sensing to rival the legendary Azure Emperor's."
"The Breath of Life technique needs deep grasp of the moon, sun and the world's own breath."
"The Lord of the Lake was an Earth Spirit who died fighting Wood-aspect corruption."
"Lord Yao, a God Beast and Master of the Grass Sea, died shielding his people."
"The Breaking, an ancient demon cataclysm, shattered Lord Yao's family."
"A past locust plague helped shatter the Dragon Veins linking distant regions."
"Checking the health of severed veins between two regions can take months."
"Moving a province's Dragon Veins usually unsettles the land, causing mutation or Qi loss."
"Qi Wastes are made by demons draining a key node in a region's Dragon Veins."
"Demons may need a hidden nexus behind a Mist Wall to fully consume a region's veins."
"A Qi Waste marks where demons fully drained a region's Dragon Veins and Earth Spirits."
"Beyond the Ironfields lies a total Qi void where the Dragon Veins are fully severed."
"Repairing a Dragon Vein needs a cultivator's steady presence as an anchor against collapse."
"Healing a Dragon Vein can turn one thin connection into three robust ones."
"Local mortal prayer and belief help a fragmented Earth Spirit's Qi take root again."
"A shattered land spirit leaves echoes of belief that can later form a new spirit."
"Where little echo of a dead spirit remains, a new one must be seeded, not left to grow."
"Twin spirits of Victory and Defeat are forming at the Dueling Peaks from years of duels."
